SUMMARY:Chan v1.2.9
DESCRIPTION:Chan 1.2.9 | Chance\n\n## New Features\n\n- New captcha cloud s
 olver\n- Small redesign of captcha form\n- Support image pasting from keyb
 oard on iOS 27\n- Rename saved attachments\n\n## General Improvements\n\n-
  Reddit comments replaced by "Edit: comment has been cleaned" will retain 
 their previous text\n- Many QUIC and HTTP/3 bugfixes and performance impro
 vements\n\n## Tweaks\n\n- Don't insert duplicate quotelinks when using "re
 ply" to open the reply form\n- Added a confirmation before clearing cookie
 s when banned\n- Hide archive name when scrolling to bottom of thread (it'
 s already there)\n- Always restart videos from beginning in gallery\n- Sli
 ght tweak of tab bar resizing for long tab titles\n\n## Bugfixes\n\n- Thre
 ads not marked as archived\n- Gallery changed image when rotating the devi
 ce\n- Compatibility error on some newer Android versions\n- Unable to tap 
 tabs on first page sometimes\n- Intermittent errors about directories not 
 existing\n- YouTube shorts embeds not shown\n- Posting multiple files on l
 ynxchan-based sites didn't work and just combined their filenames\n- Threa
 d tail requests were not properly optimized for caching\n- Cloudflare popu
 p trying to load Twitter embed data\n- Backspacing an embeddable URL in th
 e reply box would cause repeated network requests\n- Tab bar spazzed open 
 and close when slowly scrolling to the bottom of a thread
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/chan.json
